cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  PulmoCare vendors the MedRAX agent. If you use this software in academic work,
  please cite the MedRAX paper (below) in addition to (optionally) this
  repository.
title: "PulmoCare: a medical-imaging microservice platform integrating the MedRAX agent"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ammari
    given-names: Ali
    alias: aliammari1
repository-code: "https://github.com/aliammari1/pulmocare"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  PulmoCare is a research-only medical-imaging platform built as a FastAPI
  microservice mesh (Keycloak, Vault, Consul, APISIX, RabbitMQ, OpenTelemetry,
  Prometheus) with a cross-platform Flutter client. It vendors MedRAX
  (bowang-lab/MedRAX, ICML 2025), a LangGraph chest X-ray reasoning agent, and
  exposes its report-generation tools through a structured radiology-report API.
  NOT a medical device; not for clinical use.
references:
